          "descriptionHtml": "<p>Tropical Storm Ada (Nokaen) became the first cyclone of 2026 inside the PAR, with Signal No. 1 over 14 areas in Bicol, Eastern Visayas, and Caraga. PAGASA expected landfall in Eastern Visayas on January 16–17. DSWD had already extended ₱13.9 million to more than 100,000 families hit by the associated rains.</p>",
